 "strings": {
  "...My stomach hurts.": "",
  "It's dinner time.": "",
  "Looks like your buddy abandoned you.": "",
  "So much for your buddy.\nYou've been abandoned.": "",
  "D-Dammit!": "",
  "Better luck next time, asshole!": "",
  "Wait, that would be my line...\nC'mon man.": "",
  "Wait, that's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>my</font_kind> line...": "",
  "(At least that killed some time.)": "",
  "(Shouldn't be too long now 'til Saori-san gets in touch.\nI need a nap...)": "",
  "...Kuroiwa?": "",
  "I've been waiting for you.": "",
  "Why don't we step inside for a little chat?": "",
  "Another voluntary interrogation?\nThought I told you to bring a warrant next time.": "",
  "The hell was that!?": "",
  "You wanna repeat that?": "",
  "Let's be civilized here, Yagami-san.": "",
  "...Fine.\nOffice is pretty dirty, though.": "",
  "...Fine. Office is pretty dirty, though.": "",
  "So? To what do I owe the honor?": "",
  "So? What's the occasion?": "",
  "There's a leak in the prosecutor's office.": "",
  "There's a spy in the\nprosecutor's office.": "",
  "Pretty sure it's a woman. Got her hands\non some pretty important case files.": "",
  "Pretty sure it's a woman.\nGot her hands on some pretty important case files.": "",
  "The ones about the vice director of the ADDC\ngetting beaten to death in the street.": "",
  "Chief among them... a file about the vice director\nof the ADDC getting beaten to death in the street.": "",
  "You have any ideas?": "",
  "So? Any idea who?": "",
  "Sorry, not a clue.": "",
  "Ehhh, not a one.": "",
  "What kind of lowlife would sell police secrets?\nScum... Right, Ayabe?": "",
  "What kind of lowlife would sell police secrets? Honestly...\nPretty scummy. Wouldn't you say, Ayabe?": "",
  "Totally. The worst.": "",
  "...With you there.": "",
  "Nobody takes us seriously around here.": "",
  "Hmph. Nobody takes us seriously\naround here.": "",
  "That all you came to ask?": "",
  "Is that all you wanted to ask?": "",
  "I'm sure you guys are\njust as busy as I am.": "",
  "So if you're finished,\nI'm gonna have to ask you to—": "",
  "If so, I'm gonna ask you to—": "",
  "Right. Izumida wants to\ntalk to you tomorrow.": "",
  "Izumida wants to talk\nto you tomorrow.": "",
  "About Shintani's murder.\nYou'll be there. In cuffs if need be.": "",
  "About Shintani's murder.\nYou're coming in cuffs if need be.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So, these guys are just Izumida's errand boys.)</color>": "",
  "Why am I being treated like a suspect?": "",
  "Why am I getting treated\nlike a murderer here?": "",
  "Sorry, that's classified.": "",
  "Afraid that's classified.": "",
  "Just drop by the public prosecutor's office.\nIf you're innocent, you'll have nothing to worry about.": "",
  "Just drop by the public prosecutor's office.\nIf you're innocent, you'll be fine.": "",
  "You don't wanna deal with getting arrested,\ntrust me.": "",
  "Trust me here, you don't wanna deal with\ngetting arrested.": "",
  "Better to handle this before it gets\nto that point. Think of it like that.": "",
  "Better to handle this before it gets to that point.\nThink of it like that.": "",
  "Thanks for the advice.": "",
  "Besides, you and Izumida go way back.": "",
  "Besides, you and Izumida go back, right?": "",
  "But how am I gonna defend myself\nif I don't know why he suspects me?": "",
  "But if I don't know why he suspects me,\nhow am I supposed to defend myself?": "",
  "Lemme guess,\nI'll find out when I get there.": "",
  "Guess I'll find out when I get there.": "",
  "More or less.\nWho knows what angle Izumida'll take.": "",
  "Pretty much.\nWho knows what angle Izumida'll take.": "",
  "Have it your way. I'll come in and clear the air,\nand we'll be done with this.": "",
  "I get it. Fine. Sounds like I'll have to\ngo clear the air.": "",
  "I'll be in touch tomorrow.": "",
  "Tomorrow, you'll hear from us.": "",
  "Ugh, asshole's been dragging me everywhere.\nI can't do a damn thing on my own.": "",
  "Ugh, that asshole. Been dragging me everywhere lately.\nI can't do a damn thing on my own.": "",
  "I can tell. Looks rough.": "",
  "I can tell. My condolences.": "",
  "We're gonna bounce\nand go to Tender in a few.": "",
  "(Saori-san's waiting for me at Tender.\nGotta hurry.)": "",
  "Saori-san...": "",
  "Took you long enough.\nThis is Mika-san.": "",
  "Hey, I'm Yagami.\nMind if I join you?": "",
  "Be my guest.": "",
  "This is the man you served\nsix months ago? You're certain?": "",
  "...This is the man you served six months ago?\nYou're certain?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm sure.": "",
  "We already discussed Hashiki and Shono.": "",
  "Mika-san was at their table,\nwithout a doubt.": "",
  "That's Shono-san, right?": "",
  "That guy...\nThat's Shono-san, right?": "",
  "Yeah. What were they like?": "",
  "Yup. What were they like?": "",
  "I guess nothing stood out about them more than\nany other pair of businessman types.": "",
  "Well... I guess not too different from the usual\nsalarymen clients we get.": "",
  "Hashiki-san complained about his boss,\nwhile Shono-san just nodded and smiled.": "",
  "What was Hashiki saying?": "",
  "He was going on and on\nabout this Kido-san guy.": "",
  "Mostly... stuff about\nthis guy Kido-san.": "",
  "Have you heard about that\nnew dementia drug? AD-9?": "",
  "Ever heard of \"AD-9\"?\nIt's this new dementia drug.": "",
  "Uh... Yeah, I'm kinda familiar.": "",
  "Not surprised. They used to talk\nabout it on TV a bunch.": "",
  "Not surprised.\nThey used to talk about it on TV a bunch.": "",
  "Anyway. Apparently Kido-san's kind of\na big shot guy on the AD-9 research team.": "",
  "This Kido-san's apparently a higher-up\non the AD-9 research team.": "",
  "And Hashiki and Shono\nwere talking shit about him?": "",
  "And Hashiki and Shono were\ntalking shit about him?": "",
  "Sounds like Kido-san was getting wined and dined\nby all sorts of people who wanted to profit off AD-9.": "",
  "So, Kido-san... He was getting wined and dined\nby all sorts of people who wanted to profit off AD-9.": "",
  "From what I heard,\nnot all those deals were above board.": "",
  "Not all those deals were above board.\nThat's what Hashiki-san said, anyway.": "",
  "Secret deals, huh?\nIs Kido-san working with the yakuza?": "",
  "Secret deals, huh?\nIs Kido-san working with the yakuza...?": "",
  "Hashiki-san didn't give specifics.\nBut he did say AD-9 could buy a lot of influence.": "",
  "He didn't give specifics.\nBut he said it'd buy a lot of influence?": "",
  "And about the cut he'd be getting later...\nHe seemed like a really shady guy, actually.": "",
  "And he mentioned the \"slice of the pie\" he'd be getting later on.\nHe... actually seemed kinda shady.": "",
  "How was Shono acting\nthat night at the club?": "",
  "That night in the club,\nhow was Shono acting?": "",
  "Well... He spent most of the night\nstaring at my chest.": "",
  "Well, um...\nHis eyes were practically glued to my chest.": "",
  "Hashiki-san kept going on about\nKido-san all the same, though.": "",
  "Hashiki-san kept going on about Kido-san\nall the same, though.": "",
  "You don't say...": "",
  "Maintain eye contact, Yagami-san.": "",
  "That's enough \"whoa\" out of you.": "",
  "Shono-san seemed more interested in being\na creep than indulging him, though...": "",
  "He would sneak glances like I wouldn't notice.\nIt was degrading, to say the least.": "",
  "You don't think he was listening\nto Hashiki-san, then?": "",
  "Nope, didn't seem like it.": "",
  "Disgruntled boss on one side,\ncloset perv on the other...": "",
  "Disgruntled exec on one arm,\ncloset perv on the other...": "",
  "But then, out of the blue... Hashiki-san said this:": "",
  "But then, out of the blue,\nHashiki-san said this:": "",
  "There's something fishy going on\nwith AD-9, I just know it!": "",
  "\"There's something fishy going on with AD-9,\nI just know it!\"": "",
  "Did he have any idea what it was?": "",
  "Did he know for sure?": "",
  "Umm, what did he say again?\nSomething about fabrication? Or falsification?": "",
  "Data fabrication?\nFalsifying the effects of the drug?": "",
  "Yeah, that was it!": "",
  "He kept going on about how\nAD-9 was too good to be true.": "",
  "Like, something like that. He kept saying how\nAD-9 was too good to be true.": "",
  "And how weird it is that it\njust came out of nowhere.": "",
  "And like, how weird it is that\nit just came out of nowhere.": "",
  "So he brought Shono to the club\nto try and figure out if AD-9 was real.": "",
  "So Hashiki brought Shono to the club\nto try and learn the truth.": "",
  "What did Shono say?": "",
  "And what did Shono say?": "",
  "Just, \"There's nothing fishy about it!\"": "",
  "Just, \"There's nothing fishy going on!\"": "",
  "But then Hashiki-san yelled back,\n\"I don't believe that for a second!\"": "",
  "It was kinda awkward seeing\nhow desperate he was.": "",
  "It was kinda awkward,\nseeing how desperate he was.": "",
  "Makes sense he'd be desperate, though...": "",
  "Makes sense Hashiki would be\ndesperate, though...": "",
  "He promised this guy Kajihira\nhe'd shut down the ADDC.": "",
  "He made a deal with this guy Kajihira.\nSaid he'd shut down the ADDC.": "",
  "I gotta say, you remember a lot for\na conversation that happened six months ago.": "",
  "I gotta say, you remember a lot\nfor a conversation six months ago.": "",
  "Can you blame me?\nThe poor man got beaten to death right afterward.": "",
  "When I heard Hashiki-san got beaten to death\nafter he left, I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>couldn't</font_kind> forget.": "",
  "I replay this a lot...": "",
  "It was a real shock.": "",
  "Right, sorry.": "",
  "Can't argue with that.": "",
  "And at that point,\nI already knew about AD-9.": "",
  "And at that point, I already knew\nabout AD-9.": "",
  "See, my grandma\nhas pretty bad Alzheimer's.": "",
  "See, my grandma has\npretty bad Alzheimer's.": "",
  "So... I was hoping they'd\nrelease it to the public soon.": "",
  "So AD-9... could help us a lot\nif they finish it quick.": "",
  "I'm sure that made\nthe conversation stick out to you.": "",
  "Which is why you remembered\ntheir conversation so well.": "",
  "When I heard Kido-san\nwas just another slimeball, I dunno...": "",
  "So, when I heard Kido-san\nwas corrupt...": "",
  "Kinda broke my heart.": "",
  "It kinda broke my heart.": "",
  "Tragic.": "",
  "Did you ever hear Hashiki\nmention a \"Kajihira\"?": "",
  "In Hashiki and Shono's conversation,\ndid either of them mention a \"Kajihira\"?": "",
  "Kajihira...?": "",
  "It's a big construction company\nbased out of Kansai.": "",
  "It's a big Kansai construction company.": "",
  "Basically, Hashiki was working for this Kajihira.\nTrying to shut down the ADDC.": "",
  "Basically, Hashiki was Kajihira's spy.\nTrying to shut down the ADDC.": "",
  "Wait, I thought Hashiki-san was super important.\nLike, vice director or something.": "",
  "Shut them down? But I thought Hashiki-san was\nthe ADDC's vice director or something.": "",
  "He was. Kajihira's money was too much\nfor him to refuse, though.": "",
  "Hm... Either way, I don't remember\nhearing them talk about a Kajihira.": "",
  "Hm... but... I don't remember\nhearing them talk about Kajihira.": "",
  "Thanks for this, Mika-chan.\nYou must be exhausted.": "",
  "You must be pretty tired out...\nThanks.": "",
  "That's all then?": "",
  "Yeah, you helped us more than you know.\nBe safe on your way back.": "",
  "What time's your shift\nstart tomorrow, Saori-san?": "",
  "Saori-san, what time's your shift\nstart tomorrow?": "",
  "Sorry.\nI'm not coming back tomorrow.": "",
  "I'm sorry... I'm not coming back.": "",
  "It was a one-night thing. I got to see\na side of myself I didn't know I had, though.": "",
  "It was just a one-night thing.\nI... had fun seeing that side of myself, though.": "",
  "Man, this stinks.": "",
  "You're so pretty, Saori-san.\nAnd I was pumped to learn more from you.": "",
  "You're so pretty, Saori-san.\nAnd I was so pumped to learn more from you.": "",
  "I don't think I have much left to teach.": "",
  "I don't know that I have\nmuch to teach you...": "",
  "I might be able to help you, though.\nAs a friend.": "",
  "You're a lawyer...?": "",
  "You're a lawyer?": "",
  "Let me know if you ever get into trouble.": "",
  "If you ever get into trouble,\nlet me know.": "",
  "Wow, I've never been friends with a lawyer before!\nThis is like, super cool!": "",
  "Whoa, I've never had a lawyer friend before!\nThis is so cool!": "",
  "Thanks so much!\nBye now!": "",
  "Thanks. Bye!": "",
  "That was amazing, Saori-san.\nYou really pulled through for us.": "",
  "Saori-san... That was great.\nYou really pulled through for us.": "",
  "It's fine.": "",
  "It was nothing.": "",
  "C'mon, I'll walk you back to the office.": "",
  "I'll walk you back to the office.": "",
  "I wanna review what we learned\nwith Hoshino-kun and the others.": "",
  "I'd like to talk to Hoshino-kun,\nand review what we've learned.": "",
  "Welcome back!": "",
  "You're... so beautiful, Saori-san...": "",
  "You look... beautiful, Saori-san...": "",
  "Like a puppy...": "",
  "That girl's dangerous.": "",
  "You should dress like that\nall the time, Saori-kun.": "",
  "Saori-kun, why don't you dress\nlike this at the office?": "",
  "Yeah, good luck finding clients.": "",
  "You'd never get real clients...": "",
  "...I'm changing.": "",
  "There's a good chance Hashiki's\nmurder was premeditated.": "",
  "There's a good chance Hashiki\nfrom the ADDC was murdered.": "",
  "Just like Chairman Kajihira suspected.": "",
  "Just like Chairman Kajihira suspected.\nGuess his suspicions were well-founded.": "",
  "That's the conclusion\nyou and Saori-kun reached?": "",
  "That's the conclusion you and\nSaori-kun reached?": "",
  "Yeah. Hashiki thought\nsomething was up with AD-9.": "",
  "Yeah. Hashiki thought something\nwas up with AD-9.": "",
  "Doubted the authenticity of the research.\nSeemed convinced they had fabricated data.": "",
  "He doubted the authenticity of the research,\nconvinced they had fabricated data.": "",
  "He was desperately searching\nfor proof before he died.": "",
  "He was desperately searching for proof\nbefore he died.": "",
  "But, was there anything\nactually wrong with it?": "",
  "But... was there anything\nactually wrong with it?": "",
  "I tried analyzing the paper myself to find out,\nbut it's like it was written in a different language.": "",
  "Well, I tried analyzing their findings myself,\nbut it's like another language...": "",
  "I'm searching for someone\nmore knowledgeable as we speak.": "",
  "I'm looking for a qualified expert.": "",
  "But nobody seems to suspect any foul play.\nNot even online.": "",
  "But even now, nobody seems to suspect foul play.\nNot even online.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I've been waiting for you.": "รอเธออยู่เลยนะ",
  "The hell was that!?": "นั่นมันอะไรกันวะ!?",
  "Thanks for the advice.": "ขอบคุณสำหรับคำแนะนำนะคะ",
  "Be my guest.": "เชิญเลย",
  "Yeah, I'm sure.": "ใช่สินะ",
  "You don't say...": "ไม่ต้องพูดก็รู้...",
  "Can't argue with that.": "เถียงไม่ได้เลยครับ",
  "It's fine.": "ไม่เป็นไรหรอก",
  "Welcome back!": "กลับมาแล้วเหรอ!"
 }
}
